### Cadastro de usuário
POST http://localhost:3001/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teste@email.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3001/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teste@email.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Listar usuários
GET http://localhost:3001/users
Authorization: Bearer cole_o_token_aqui

### Buscar usuário por ID
GET http://localhost:3001/users/1
Authorization: Bearer cole_o_token_aqui

### Atualizar usuário
PUT http://localhost:3001/users/1
Authorization: Bearer cole_o_token_aqui
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "novo@email.com",
  "password": "654321"
}

### Deletar usuário
DELETE http://localhost:3001/users/1
Authorization: Bearer cole_o_token_aqui

### Criar tarefa
POST http://localhost:3001/tasks
Authorization: Bearer cole_o_token_aqui
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Estudar Node.js",
  "description": "Revisar Fastify, pg e JWT"
}

### Listar tarefas
GET http://localhost:3001/tasks
Authorization: Bearer cole_o_token_aqui

### Buscar tarefa por ID
GET http://localhost:3001/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer cole_o_token_aqui

### Atualizar tarefa
PUT http://localhost:3001/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer cole_o_token_aqui
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Estudar Node.js (atualizado)",
  "description": "Incluir testes das rotas no REST Client"
}

### Deletar tarefa
DELETE http://localhost:3001/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer cole_o_token_aqui
